    "id": "year7-english-lesson-4-past-progressive",
    "title": "Lesson 4: Past Progressive & Continuous Timelines – Actions in Progress",
    "description": "Master the Past Progressive tense, form subject-auxiliary agreement with was/were, combine ongoing background actions with interrupted events using 'when' and 'while', and navigate stative verb rules.",
    "author": "AST English Academy",
    "level": "Year 7 / KS3",
    "duration": 30,
